<title>JAPAN: Cabin Co -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Cabin Co -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.05		vs	   22.06</p>
<p> Operating   loss 887    million	  vs   loss 405    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 529    million	  vs   loss 267    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 930    million	  vs   loss 490    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 19.40 yen	  vs    loss 10.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     48 million	  vs	  48 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Cabin Co Ltd is a chain store operator handling casual wear.</p>
